	July 6 – 10:30 am\n\n\n\n\n\nJuly 13 – 10:30 am\n\n\n\n\n\nJuly 20 – 10:30
	 am\n\n\n\n\n\nJuly 27 – 10:30 am\n\n\n\n\n\naugust 3 – 10:30 am\n\n\n\n\n
	\n\nPlease come dressed for the outdoors\, including closed-toe shoes.  \n
